{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43202","headline":"阳春歌 · 吴象之","name":"阳春歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帘低晓露湿，帘卷莺声急。\n欲起把箜篌，如凝彩弦涩。\n孤眠愁不转，点泪声相及。\n净扫阶上花，风来更吹入。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴象之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43202.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43202","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}